in main
  an owned string shortened keeps its block: 1
  the same length keeps it too: 1
  a write after it needs no copy: 1
  a join reads only the length: 1
  a grow takes a new block and its new characters are zero: 1
  a shared string shortened gets a block of its own: 1
  so does the other holder: 1
  a literal shortened is copied: 1
  a view shortened is copied and its block never written: 1
  an element, a field and a var parameter keep their blocks: 1
  a join and a Copy are their own and keep theirs too: 1
  shortened to nothing it is the empty string: 1
16 routines at once, every case held: 1
